  "method_notes": "Unweighted ordinary least squares on 24 targets (MUSCLES v22 including Proxima Cen and the 4 K dwarfs, Mega-MUSCLES v25); parameter covariance uses sigma^2 = RSS/(N-2). Intrinsic scatter follows the Kelly (2007, ApJ 665, 1489) likelihood with negligible measurement errors: per-star variance is a single constant sigma^2, whose posterior under a Jeffreys prior is InverseGamma((N-2)/2, RSS/2). L_X band is ROSAT 0.1-2.4 keV (5.17-124 A); a 5-100 A alternative and an M-dwarf-only fit are included as alternates. All ratios come from the SED BOLOFLUX column, so distances cancel. Engle used the superseded Mega-MUSCLES v23 release, which MAST no longer distributes; see module docstring for all documented judgment calls."
